2. For the purposes of section 15(5B) of the Act, a claim in respect of a vehicle removed to a place of safety or any other place must be made in one of the following ways:
(a)by post addressed to the Land Transport Authority of Singapore at 10 Sin Ming Drive, Singapore 575701;
(b)online at http://www.lta.gov.sg;
(c)by email addressed to feedback@lta.gov.sg.
